WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.670
<b>Yuki-chan Doesn't Care</b>

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:47.730
So then what?

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.250
And then...

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.370
You kick up like, bam!

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:51.550
That seems so weak.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:54.710
Chio-chan! Manana-chan!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.510
Oh, it's Yuki-chan.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.260
Good morning!

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:58.680
Good—

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.860
Y-Yuki-chan, wh-what are you wearing?

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:17.910
There's a track meet this weekend, 
and I've just been so excited about it!

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:20.810
Shall we head to school?

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.570
Huh?!

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.140
This isn't a joke?

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:24.750
Hey.

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.960
So, uh, about what you're wearing...

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:28.990
Hmm?

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.690
U-Um...

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.170
<i>She's actually not embarrassed about it...</i>

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:38.810
<i>Then again, I guess she does 
track meets wearing that,</i>

00:02:38.810 --> 00:02:41.780
<i>so maybe it's rude to think 
she might get embarrassed...</i>

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:43.800
That's...

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:46.010
really cute!

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:46.820
I know, right?

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:48.060
<i>You're so wishy-washy!</i>

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.650
Really, it looks great!

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:53.770
<i>But I never knew Yuki-san was like this.</i>

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.880
Yay!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.110
<i>After walking to school 
together a few times,</i>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.530
<i>we're close enough that 
I can call her by name...</i>

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.140
<i>and I thought she was just the popular 
character type, but also... naïve?</i>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.760
<i>She may say that she doesn't 
care, but this outfit...</i>

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:09.330
<i>is way too sexy!</i>

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.000
What do you think?

00:03:09.850 --> 00:03:11.580
<i>And Chio-chan's acting like that.</i>

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.580
Yeah, that's cool!

00:03:11.970 --> 00:03:14.420
<i>All right, fine.</i>

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.860
<i>I didn't think Yuki-san 
was that type of person,</i>

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:20.350
<i>but I know how to deal 
with embarrassing people!</i>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:26.020
<i>I'm not Chio-chan, but I don't want to 
stand out for the wrong reasons, either.</i>

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:29.100
<i>I'm going to knock some 
common sense into Yuki-san.</i>

00:03:29.570 --> 00:03:30.540
Yuki-san.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.230
Can you come with me to the 
convenience store over there?

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:35.800
Sure!

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.460
<i>It's the convenience store 
nearest the station!</i>

00:03:39.460 --> 00:03:43.070
<i>I never come here because 
the lines are too long, but...</i>

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.240
It's so crowded.

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:51.460
<b>Convenience Store</b>

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.310
<i>I call this the "I Put On Something 
Random to Go Shopping Nearby,</i>

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:53.500
<i>But They Didn't Have What I Was Looking For,</i>

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.460
<b>Department Store</b>

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.710
<i>So I Went Downtown and Suddenly, 
I'm Embarrassed by How I Look" plan!</i>

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.380
I-I'm not usually dressed like this...

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.170
<b>Commence Plan</b>

00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:01.170
<i>Commence plan!</i>

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.800
A high school girl's bare legs...

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:06.930
Is that a swimsuit?

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.380
<i>Great reactions, everyone.</i>

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:16.160
So what are you going to buy?

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.840
Uh, this new bread they got in.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:21.360
<i>They're totally staring, Yuki-san!</i>

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:25.220
Ooh, a penguin!

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:28.080
<i>All the guys are sneaking peeks at 
her, but she really doesn't care.</i>

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:29.950
Are you done?

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:32.470
<i>At this point, I'll just have to be direct!</i>

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.400
Yuki-san, because of how you're dressed...

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:37.920
Everyone's staring at you.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.590
Yeah, it's so exciting! 
It's like I'm at a track meet!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:45.760
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:04:46.420 --> 00:04:50.840
<i>I mean, I'm sure she's surrounded by even
more people at track meets, but...</i>

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.020
<i>Could it be that Yuki-san's an exhibitionist?</i>

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.570
<i>She's on a different level than the
Kabaddi Club's Kushitori-senpai,</i>

00:04:56.570 --> 00:04:58.110
<i>but maybe Yuki-san is that type...</i>

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:00.980
What's your best event again, Yuki-san?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:02.990
The 1,500-meter run!

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:04.780
Huh? Where's Chio-chan?

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.240
Oh, she said she was going to the bathroom...

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.470
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.840
Wow, a tennis skirt!

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:16.700
What's that?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.400
I'm going to wear it at my match.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:22.370
<i>I guess she did mention that she 
had her club outfit today...</i>

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.800
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:33.720
<i>She actually sacrificed herself to 
make things a little less awkward?</i>

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:36.460
<i>You've grown so much, Chio-chan.</i>

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:40.690
A pen is a pen, but what's 
a pen that's this long?

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.190
<i>Wait, that's not it...</i>

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.440
Here's a hint... It was 
at the convenience store.

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:47.700
<i>She just wants to hide her 
face, plain and simple!</i>

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.890
<i>She couldn't just leave Yuki-san behind,</i>

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.540
<i>but she also doesn't want to stand out.</i>

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:57.750
<i>So she's taking advantage 
of Yuki-san's presence</i>

00:05:54.950 --> 00:06:00.290
Stares

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.290
<i>and wearing her tennis 
skirt as a mini disguise.</i>

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:03.420
<i>This way, Yuki-san won't feel bad,</i>

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.480
<i>and with her face hidden,</i>

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.260
<i>people will know she's in the soft 
tennis club, but not who she is.</i>

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.880
<i>To ensure her peaceful high school life,</i>

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:12.230
<i>she's always willing to 
take below-average risks...</i>

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:16.190
<i>This is Chio-chan's art 
of being below average!</i>

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.100
Art of Being Below Average

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.960
<i>You'd actually go that far...</i>

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.930
Yuki-san!

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.340
What is it, Manana-chan?

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:27.750
You said that your best event 
was the 1,500-meter run, right?

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:28.700
Yup!

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:32.070
I just happened to look at a map,
and it just so happens

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:35.420
that we're 1,500 meters away 
from school right now!

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:39.760
<i>Wait, is she ignoring me?</i>

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:42.790
Really?

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.130
<i>She heard me!</i>

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:48.010
<i>Yuki-san may be an exhibitionist, 
but she loves running even more.</i>

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.340
<i>Just a little push, and...</i>

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:54.140
You know, there's such a nice breeze today.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:00.270
If you just happened to run to school on a 
day like this when there's a nice tailwind...

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.820
I bet it'd feel really nice...

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:07.440
<i>It's working!</i>

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:11.260
You can leave us behind and run.

00:07:12.050 --> 00:07:12.990
Huh?

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:16.090
<i>Wait, that's not good.</i>

00:07:16.430 --> 00:07:20.510
<i>If Yuki-chan leaves,
I'll stand out in this skirt!</i>

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:26.550
<i>Manana!</i>

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:30.270
Hey, wait! I think it'd be more fun 
if we all went to school together!

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:31.430
Don't you, Yuki-chan?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:35.290
Yuki-san, I'll hold your bag for you.

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:38.100
But we promised we'd all go 
to school together today!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:40.110
Wait, that hurts...

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:42.730
<i>I won!</i>

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:47.820
I found something cool at the 
convenience store earlier.

00:07:48.760 --> 00:07:49.750
<i>What?</i>

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:55.870
Y-You wouldn't...

00:07:56.270 --> 00:08:00.140
On your marks... Get set...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.540
Take my bag for me!

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.900
Chio-chan, you look mighty 
cute in that skirt.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:15.430
Yeah, well, I...

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.930
I guess we should head to school.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:18.850
Um...

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.390
Please be merciful. 
Let me change somewhere.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.710
What? Oh, I don't know...

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:29.340
Man, Yuki-chan's intense.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:32.490
I'm not sure if I should 
call her brave, or...

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:34.410
What?

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.820
I was just remembering how 
something similar once happened.

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.200
A long time ago, when we were 
going to the local pool...

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.350
Chio-chan!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.080
Mana—

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.040
<b>Nonomura</b>

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.420
Here I am!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.460
What the?! We're supposed 
to change once we get there!

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:48.940
You came already dressed in your swimsuit.

00:08:50.120 --> 00:08:51.390
And then...

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.170
Let's not talk about that!

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.720
We're not going to talk about that!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.720
<b>Chio's</b>

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:59.720
School Road

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.930
<i>Chio's... School Road</i>...

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.020
By the way, why do you play soft tennis 
when we have a normal tennis club, too?

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.560
Because soft tennis is a lot more fun.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.410
Are the two that different to begin with?

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.990
They're totally different!

00:09:10.990 --> 00:09:12.810
Soft tennis balls are made of rubber,

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:14.900
so when you stick them into 
the space in your racket

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:16.950
and swing as hard as you can...

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:19.620
The ball flies super far, 
and it's so much fun!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.990
That's why?!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.370
<b>A super easy diet
without exercising!!</b>

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:26.000
<b>Chio Fisher</b>

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:24.370
I'm so glad I was born in this day and age!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.900
So, like...

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.910
This new game's so action-packed!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.460
Really?

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:32.800
Are you listening, Manana?

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.090
<b>A super easy diet
without exercising!!</b>

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.090
Hmm? Yeah, I'm listening.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.800
So what do you think they'd do if 
they got caught in a narrow alley?

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.720
There aren't even any doors around!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.810
What would you do, Manana?!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:49.020
The answer is... You hold out both 
of your arms and legs, like this...

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:51.860
You get it? Your body is in the air, and...

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.830
Manana!

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.990
I gained two kilos, so I'm 
in a life or death situa—

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:02.010
What?

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:02.790
Like this!

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.770
<i>Uh... The hell?</i>

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.750
And then...

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:14.530
Bang!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:17.180
Manana, you're not supposed to dodge!

00:10:18.170 --> 00:10:20.940
It must be fun being you, Chio-chan.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:23.390
As for me, there are so many diet methods

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.680
that I don't know which one I can trust...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:28.170
Hey, you're Nonomura-san, right?

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.400
It's been a while!

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:31.690
Hey.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.650
Ah...

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.730
<i>Who's he?!</i>

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.650
I'm one of Yuki-chan's 
running friends, Ushida.

00:10:39.650 --> 00:10:41.800
What?! From that one time?!

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:45.040
Wow! You lost so much weight!

00:10:45.890 --> 00:10:47.430
It's all thanks to Yuki-chan.

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:50.270
It's because you worked so hard, Ushida-san!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:51.450
No, I really owe it all to her.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.520
Is she that amazing?

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.010
<i>Uh, Manana-san...</i>

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.460
She is!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:59.310
<i>You seem to be having fun down there, 
but did you forget about me?</i>

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.590
<b>Mugita Café</b>

00:10:58.070 --> 00:11:01.400
Exercise is obviously important, 
but so is your lifestyle!

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:03.240
Ah, your lifestyle.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.220
Carbs are key, too.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.710
Wh-What are carbs?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.640
<i>This pose completely exposes my panties...</i>

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:10.890
They're called carbohydrates...

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:12.980
<i>It doesn't look like Manana's 
going to shoo Ushida-san away...</i>

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.420
<i>Actually, depending on how you look at this,</i>

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.960
<i>I might look like some nympho trying 
to show Ushida-san my panties...</i>

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.860
Lookie, lookie!

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.660
I need to escape upward so my 
panties aren't as visible.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:29.340
<i>Too bad you weren't able to 
see my panties, Ushida-san.</i>

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.000
<i>No one's noticed me.</i>

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:40.420
Wait... Is this basically 
the game world right now?

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:44.760
I lurk in the shadows, fade into 
darkness, and strike my enemies!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:50.500
I'm the ultimate spy... Chio Fisher.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:51.440
<b><i>Chio Fisher</i></b>

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.150
Whoa, a spider!

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:58.000
Damn it. Ever since they built 
that building next door,

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.110
it's so humid here, and we 
get way more more bugs.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.280
I hate bugs.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.580
<i>Shit... At this rate...</i>

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:13.750
Yasui! We had a spray to get 
rid of spiderwebs, didn't we?

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.260
Could you get it for me real quick?

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.540
Sure thing.

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.550
<i>Shit! He's going to see me!</i>

00:12:19.720 --> 00:12:21.340
<i>This is my only chance!</i>

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:27.140
<i>This guy's huge, so they won't
be able to see me from inside!</i>

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:32.430
Spray...

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.140
Hey, get the one on the bottom, too.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:36.340
Sure.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:39.570
Get into that corner more. Right there, idiot.

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:38.850
Oh, here?

00:12:38.850 --> 00:12:40.320
Spray...

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:52.470
Th-That almost gave me a heart attack!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:05.510
<i>Oh, man... I'm having so much fun!</i>

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:09.120
<i>I want to keep at it! 
I should just go to the top.</i>

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:13.640
<i>If this were a game and I went 
somewhere you usually can't go...</i>

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.650
<i>there'd be an amazing 
rare item waiting for me!</i>

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.380
Well, I'll be going now.

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:23.680
Okay. Thank you so much!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.180
Oh, yeah, Chio-chan—

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:26.700
What?!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.660
Chio—

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:35.650
<i>It probably wouldn't be good to make a fuss...</i>

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:41.300
<i>What? When did she get all the way up there?</i>

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.680
Safe.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:53.770
<i>What the hell... are you doing?!</i>

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:56.060
Just a little more...

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:00.980
<i>You're always senselessly 
putting yourself in danger...</i>

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.080
Oh, there you are.

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:08.820
Sorry about that.

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.030
She seems a bit young to be here...

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:48.590
Um...

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:51.820
My dad forgot his lunch,
so I brought it for him.

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:57.060
Such a nice girl...

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.920
By the way, who's your dad?

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:08.060
I guess she didn't want to say.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:14.960
She might just be at that age.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.900
Man, this feels so nice!

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.480
And now, a selfie.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.240
Hey, Manana, are you watching?

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:25.270
Actually, yes, I am.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:31.630
Ma... na... na...

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:37.740
Chio!

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:40.860
<i>Whenever Manana calls me "Chio,"</i>

00:15:40.860 --> 00:15:42.540
<i>it means she's super pissed off!</i>

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:46.000
W... Wait, Manana!

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.270
Chio!

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:09.700
Just let me hit you at times like these.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.650
Manana!

00:16:17.110 --> 00:16:19.230
Thank goodness!

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.960
Wh-What?

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:27.900
You have no athletic ability,

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:31.960
so I thought you were going to fall 
to your death when you jumped.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.560
Manana!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:46.440
<i>But you came for me...</i>

00:16:47.890 --> 00:16:49.050
<i>I see.</i>

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.870
<i>So the rare item I found 
on the roof was friendship.</i>

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:57.830
Now, then...

00:17:04.010 --> 00:17:07.000
Since Manana was able to make 
it through this building,

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.910
it's probably a safer route.

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:09.740
Okay.

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:18.280
Hey, that girl... She said she 
was bringing her dad's lunch...

00:17:18.280 --> 00:17:21.180
<i>Lunch? Oh, so that's how...</i>

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:25.400
Yes. She's actually the oldest of ten,

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.560
and her family's going 
through some rough times...

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.790
She's been lying that she's on a diet

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:32.900
so she could spare more food 
for the rest of her family.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:37.450
Then she messaged me from the bathroom 
here, saying that she suddenly felt ill.

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:41.390
Wh-What... What a nice girl!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.330
<i>And now, we run!</i>

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.330
<b>Chio's</b>

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:47.330
School Road

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.380
<i>Chio's School Road</i>!

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:51.270
By the way, you should probably delete 
that picture you took on the roof.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:54.210
Huh? B-But I didn't take a picture...

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.590
Liar! I know there's something!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:05.980
<b>Momo-chan's Story</b>

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:04.790
The water tastes so good!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:08.060
But should we really drink 
this much tap water?

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.060
Yes, it's perfectly fine.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.610
You might be worried about the chlorine,

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:16.900
but the chlorine level in Japan's water 
is much lower than rest of the world.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:21.220
This school is a fairly new building, 
too, so the pipes are still—

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:24.290
Sorry, I wasn't <i>that</i> interested.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.750
Man, you're mean.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.510
She's so annoying.

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.730
Morning.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:39.220
<i>There's something I don't understand.</i>

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.140
<i>That student isn't following the dress code,</i>

00:18:43.550 --> 00:18:47.780
<i>so why doesn't Gotou-sensei,
the student counselor, say anything?</i>

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:54.480
Good morning.

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:55.860
Good morning.

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.200
<i>I'll do better today.</i>

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:07.450
Your day
should start
with a
cheerful greeting

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:07.450
<b>Let's
conserve
paper</b>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.800
<i>My idea the other day failed.</i>

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:07.450
<i>It probably looked like I was 
showing off my knowledge.</i>

00:19:07.710 --> 00:19:09.870
<i>I need to work harder for everyone.</i>

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:14.500
That's all from me. 
Any comments or questions?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.360
Yes, ma'am.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:17.880
Yes, Shinozuka-san?

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:20.100
Regarding our results on the last test,

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:23.270
our class scored lower 
than the other classes.

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:25.450
So, this is just my own method,

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:28.180
How do we increase our class's average?
I propose an effective method for studying at home
After school
Free time | Studying at home time

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:28.180
but I put together some ideas for 
how to study at home effectively.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.850
I was hoping it would be useful to everyone.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:34.230
The key factor in this study method...

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:38.200
Sorry, it's time for club, 
so I'm gonna get going.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.530
Same here.

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.580
I'm going home, too.

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:43.320
I don't study at home, anyway.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.440
What was that?

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.590
A new way for the 
goody-two-shoes to annoy us?

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.250
Shinozuka's unbelievable.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.450
U-Um...

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.670
Shinozuka-san...

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:57.190
Our lessons follow the curriculum guidelines,

00:19:57.190 --> 00:20:00.510
so if you have any concerns 
with how we're teaching...

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.930
<b>Combustible Waste
Remember to separate your trash</b>

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.680
<i>There's something I don't understand.</i>

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:10.570
<i>Why? Why? Why? Why?</i>

00:20:14.680 --> 00:20:15.650
Hold it.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.320
Why?

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:19.570
Why?

00:20:21.780 --> 00:20:23.910
Why is it just me?!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:27.790
The reason I stopped you is because

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:30.700
you looked like you wanted me to stop you.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:34.550
Don't you want someone to listen 
to what you have to say?

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:37.380
How do we increase our class's average?
I propose an effective method for studying at home
After school
Free time | Studying at home time

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.250
What an interesting idea.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.550
Splitting everyone up into 
groups based on their clubs

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.470
to find out their strengths and weaknesses...

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.890
There are parts that are slightly biased, 
but there are also parts that I agree with.

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:51.810
Most importantly, this is 
filled with good intentions.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:57.400
Say, Shinozuka, why don't you 
join the disciplinary committee?

00:20:57.850 --> 00:20:59.780
If you speak as a member 
of the disciplinary committee,

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.170
it might be easier to 
get through to everyone.

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.180
I'm sure you'd be perfect for the position.

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:07.110
No...

00:21:07.750 --> 00:21:10.030
I'm sure there are many others like me.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:14.770
No, we don't need someone like you. 
We need <i>you</i>, Shinozuka.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:21.230
No... I...

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.110
I-I...

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.570
<b>Disciplinary</b>

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:45.990
<b>Unkempt clothes could lead to disciplinary disorder</b>

